{"id": "66260", "title": "军门悍女，强宠娇夫", "author": "第八个字母", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66260.htm", "intro": "本文一对一，女追男，女宠男，女追男躲，乐趣无限 \r\n———————————————————————\r\n她与他，三次见面，不欢而散，四次见面，四见钟情…\r\n四见钟情，却只是单恋。\r\n她姓北堂，他姓南宫，或许他们的前世南辕北辙，今生却注定缠绵不清。\r\n初见，他是匪，她是军，他险险逃掉，她却感叹自己即将到手的功绩就这样溜走。\r\n再次见面，他对她满眼仇视，因她，他失去了多少好兄弟，而她看他的眼神却只有惋惜？\r\n三次见面，他重伤濒死，她救了他，他不但不感激她，还对她恶言相向？终于，从她手中溜走…\r\n四见钟情，她终于明白了她对他的感情，他竟然险些成了她的大舅哥？既如此，大舅哥，接招吧！\r\n————\r\n【片段一】\r\n北堂雪将一枚黑色的药丸塞进南宫洛的嘴里，南宫洛僵硬道：“这是什么？”\r\n“让你爱上我的东西。”\r\n“你能不能别那么幼稚，这你也信？”\r\n“有你求我的时候。”\r\n“丫的，这到底是是什么啊？”\r\n“媚骨欢。”\r\n【片段二】\r\n“不是来参加婚礼的吗？”\r\n“对啊。”\r\n“人呢？”\r\n“到齐了。”\r\n“啊？”\r\n“我昨天找人装作你，用你的证件，现在咱俩已经领证了。”", "base": "files/article/html/66/66260", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "9956724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-12", "file": "9956725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-19", "file": "9956726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-25", "file": "9956727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-32", "file": "9956728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-39", "file": "9956729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-46", "file": "9956730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "47-52", "file": "9956731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "53-57", "file": "9956732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-63", "file": "9956733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-71", "file": "9956734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "72-76", "file": "9956735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-80", "file": "9956736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-4", "file": "9956737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-10", "file": "9956738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9956739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-21", "file": "9956740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-27", "file": "9956741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-32", "file": "9956742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-37", "file": "9956743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-40", "file": "9956744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-3", "file": "9956745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-6", "file": "9956746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-9", "file": "9956747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10-12完结", "file": "9956748.html", "available": false}]}